# Harvinder Telecom E-Commerce — Build Fix Overlay

This ZIP contains only the files to copy into the root of the existing e-commerce repository. It is not a complete standalone application.

1. Create branch `fix/build-and-ci` from `main`.
2. Extract this ZIP.
3. Copy the contents (not an outer folder) to the existing repository root, preserving `.github/workflows` and `docs` paths.
4. Install dependencies, run all checks, commit, push, open a PR, and wait for the GitHub Actions workflow.
5. Read `docs/GITHUB_SETUP_GUIDE.md` for full Windows/GitHub Desktop instructions.

No deployment or remote Cloudflare resources are created by these files. A passing build is not yet claimed; it must be confirmed by CI.

